Dear Tru64 admins,

I had asked:

> [...]
> I now want to replace the (original) Digital TGA graphics card
> with a Matrox Millennium G200 (PCI version), but the ARC version
> can not handle this card. A (Compaq) expert on Alpha Linux graphics
