I don't know, and it's my understanding that the license package varies
based on geography, that is, that it's not necessarily the same in all
countries around the world.

The license code you need is "TCR-UA" and in a pinch I could find you
a test license that would be good for several months (intended for use
in external field test).  But you need to confirm that it's supposed
to be in the Campus License package in your country.  If you've got
the TCS-UA license (the one for V4.x), then I'd expect that the new
one should be there as well, but it may not be due to administrative
errors (that is, whoever created the package didn't realize that the
license code changed in V5.0A from TCS-UA to TCR-UA and failed to put
both license PAKs in the kit).

