Subject: SUMMARY: NFS Server not responding even though it's not being used.
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=102653680322085


Hi,

Apparently there was one of the NFS servers used by the automounter
currently down. As explained to me by Dan Riley, the automounter contains
a user-mode NFS server as well. Now when the automounter has a problem
mounting some filesystem, this message can appear. I've removed the
problematic NFS server from the automounter table and all is well now.

