From tru64-unix-managers  Thu Sep 13 16:35:14 2001
From: "Mohamed K. Ahmed" <mkahmed () vsc ! teksystems ! com>
Date: Thu, 13 Sep 2001 16:35:14 +0000
To: tru64-unix-managers
Subject: SUMMARY: slow network
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=102653680321943

Thanks to all who responded, Jeff Hummel, Scott Ruffner, Rob Sloane, 
Selden Ball and Paul LaMadeleine.

All of them suggested to check the settings on the NIC card and compare 
it to the settings for its port on the switch, which I did, found out 
that the switch was set to 100/Full while my systems NIC were set to 
100/half.
Since I couldn't set the system's NIC to 100/Full without getting the 
NIC down, I have asked the network guy to set the ports on the switch 
to 100/Half till next down time.

Thanx to all

MKMA
