To: tru64-unix-managers
Subject: SUMMARY: DU 4.0D PANIC: RECEIVE 3
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=102653680321789


Thanks to Bryan Lavelle from Compaq for this one,

His suggestion was to wait for 4.0D Patch Kit 9, which has
now been released, which should contain a fix for this issue,
or get the patch for case #BCSM30828.

I have installed patch kit 9, and the problem seems to have
disappeared. I have a 2-week uptime and no "Panic: Receive 3"
troubles. Before the patch, usually I would get the panic 
after a week or so of uptime.

Previously, I was running Patch Kit 8. I didn't have the problem
when I was running Patch Kit 4 beforehand, so the problem seems
to have been introduced somewhere between Patch Kit 5 and 8.

For those running 4.0D Bryan also reminded me that Compaq will
release no more patch kits for this version of DU, since
engineering support ceased on June 30th.

Brad Bell.

